- parity-check.sh, parity-check.ps1 and npm run lint;
- bash -n and ParseFile on both wrappers;
- the JetBrains test that covers the provider label, under the jetbrains-gradle lease if a Kotlin test changes.
Do not run postflight.ps1 or postflight.sh.
